[_description]
Package: com.snowgears.shop.hook. Arclight, Bolt, CashierLock, GeyserFloodgate, Land, Lands, Residence, WorldGuard hooks.

[_does]
Checks player permissions in claimed areas (Arclight, Land, Lands, Residence, WorldGuard), allows trusted players to open shop containers (Bolt, CashierLock), detects Bedrock players via Geyser/Floodgate.

[_careful]

[_careful/Compatibility]
CashierLock API accessed via reflection; fails open if API not found. GeyserFloodgateHook checks GeyserApi.api() and FloodgateApi.getInstance(). GriefPrevention3D hook uses same me.ryanhamshire.GriefPrevention package.

[_summary]
Integration hooks for external protection and economy plugins. Provides compatibility with Arclight, Bolt, CashierLock, GeyserMC/Floodgate, Land, Lands, Residence, and WorldGuard.

[_conclusions]
Hooks use best-effort integration: if a plugin is not installed, the hook does nothing. GriefPrevention3D replaces standard GriefPrevention.

